"Ton" or "MT" means a metric ton of 2,204.52 English pounds; and
"Transaction" means an agreement made in accordance herewith for the purchase, sale or exchange of Product to be performed hereunder.
Other terms are elsewhere defined in this Agreement and shall, for purposes of this Agreement, have the meanings so specified unless the context otherwise requires. 



